  "_about": "THE MINK (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/carn/mink.py): built from the least weasel (its rig and sculpt: the long low mustelid build) at 1.85 -- not the otter at half size, which is too broad and flat-tailed -- and reshaped: the trunk 10-14% fuller with a gentle arch, stouter legs, a flat pointed head with tiny ears barely above the fur; an 18 cm bushy-ish tapering tail (one sweep); one glossy deep chocolate brown all over (the weasel's white belly gone), near-black legs and tail, a small white chin and lower lip (paints). Written whole by its script.",
